https://huggingface.co/Velandris/velandris-license

Copyright (c) 2026 Han Muyang. You may copy and distribute this license text verbatim. You must not change it.

## How to apply this license

To apply the Velandris License to your model:
- add this file to your repository as `LICENSE`, unchanged;
- add a `NOTICE` file containing your name and the attribution text that recipients must reproduce;
- set the following in the metadata of your model card:

```yaml
license: other
license_name: velandris
license_link: https://huggingface.co/Velandris/velandris-license/blob/main/LICENSE.md
```

